Dialogue: 9,0:00:00.92,0:00:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Sirotan
Dialogue: 9,0:00:07.76,0:00:09.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Nasıl sence? Havalı mı?
Dialogue: 9,0:00:09.99,0:00:11.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Havalı!
Dialogue: 9,0:00:11.58,0:00:13.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Ben yarasayım.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:13.82,0:00:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Güzel.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:14.50,0:00:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Sana yakışmış.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:15.89,0:00:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Sirotan ne zaman gelecek?
Dialogue: 9,0:00:18.31,0:00:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Nasıl bir kostüm giyecek acaba?
Dialogue: 9,0:00:23.36,0:00:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,O da neydi öyle?
Dialogue: 9,0:00:32.51,0:00:34.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, Sirotan.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:35.35,0:00:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,O donut kostümü mü?
Dialogue: 9,0:00:38.64,0:00:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Donutu yiyecektim sonra sıkışıp kaldım.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:43.00,0:00:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Bu kostüm sayılır mı ki?
Dialogue: 9,0:00:46.12,0:00:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Güzel kokuyor değil mi?
Dialogue: 9,0:00:48.03,0:00:50.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Çok lezzetli bir kostüm.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:50.31,0:00:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Keşke ben de lezzetli bir kostüm giyseymişim.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:55.51,0:00:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Birlikte yiyelim.
